<title>USA: Medtronic Inc raises dividend.</title>
<headline>Medtronic Inc raises dividend.</headline>
<dateline>MINNEAPOLIS 1997-06-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Quarterly</p>
<p>			Latest		    Prior</p>
<p> Amount		  $0.11		    $0.095</p>
<p> Pay		     Aug 1</p>
<p> Record		 July 3</p>
<p>NOTE: Medtronic said new dividend rate reflects board's intention to increase the annual dividend for fiscal 1998 by $0.06 to $0.44, which is consistent with the company's objective of distributing approximately 20 percent of the prior year's earnings per share as dividends.</p>
<p>((Reuters Chicago Newsdesk (312) 408-8787))</p>
